<Prose title="Privacy Policy" eyebrow="Legal" updated="October 28, 2026" description="How Electroys collects, uses and protects information.">
  <p>This policy explains how Electroys (“we”) handles information when you visit electroys.com, subscribe to our emails, contact us or follow links to other websites.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Newsletter sign-ups.</strong> Your first name and email address, plus the date and the page you signed up from. We use these only to send the emails you asked for and to process unsubscribes. Sign-ups are processed with Google Apps Script and stored in Google Sheets.</li>
    <li><strong>Messages.</strong> If you email us, we receive what you send and use it to reply.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage information.</strong> We use Google Analytics 4 to understand which pages are useful. It uses cookies and similar technologies to collect information such as pages viewed, referring sites, approximate location, and device and browser type. We also record anonymous events such as clicks on product links, saves to a gift list and Kit Finder completions. These events contain product identifiers, not personal details.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Your saved gift list</h2>
  <p>Hearts you tap are saved in your own browser’s local storage. They are not sent to us. Clearing your browser data removes them. If you share a list, the product IDs are placed in the link you share; anyone with the link can see those products.</p>
  <h2>Privacy signals</h2>
  <p>If your browser sends Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track, we don’t send our custom interaction events to Google Analytics. You can also opt out of Google Analytics with <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google’s browser add-on</a>. Learn how Google uses data in <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">its partner-sites policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>When you click a retailer link such as Amazon, that retailer may set cookies to attribute your purchase to Electroys. Their own privacy policies apply on their sites. We never receive your payment or address details.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Electroys is written for parents, relatives, educators and adult makers. Our email list is for adults 18 and over. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has submitted information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>
  <h2>Retention and your choices</h2>
  <p>We keep newsletter details until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete them. You can unsubscribe at any time from any email, or email us to access, correct or delete your information.</p>
  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy as the site changes; the date above shows the latest version. Questions: <a href="mailto:myelectroys@gmail.com">myelectroys@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</Prose>
